	)
	(text "ADC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c8d6fee-50e3-4a74-96e0-de708e2a15c8")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70ae86fe-383a-4a69-8198-2aa8f404f769")
	)
	(text "ADC DRVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7cf1be73-d47b-475b-be01-56f52db72068")
	)
	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81a30970-ea88-438a-935a-ab289a559d6f")
	)
	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "af47797e-cac9-4c99-bde1-6e6df0cbbb95")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bbaa306c-29f0-4535-a0f0-bf34c6de6bc3")
	)
	(text "GIRIS VE KORUMA — NETLIST.md §9\n9-18 V aku ya da tezgah kaynagi. Ters polarite sahada bir kere olur, yeter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bfedcab1-dd93-4665-851c-bd8426a9aa12")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4309f12-458d-40fa-affc-8781fc425dd1")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9b0618b-f6f7-4a59-be24-ffa1caa3acd6")
	)
